  "question": {
    "text": "If <math> <mi>f</mi><mfenced> <mi>x</mi> </mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup> <mfenced> <mrow> <mfrac> <mrow> <mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow> <mrow> <mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow> </mfrac> </mrow> </mfenced> <mrow> <mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow> </msup> </math>, then <math> <msup> <mi>f</mi> <mo>′</mo> </msup> <mfenced> <mn>0</mn> </mfenced> </math> is equal to",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
